{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33023","headline":"从天平节度使游平流园 · 曹邺","name":"从天平节度使游平流园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"池塘静於寺，俗事不到眼。\n下马如在山，令人忽疎散。\n明公有高思，到此遂长返。\n乘兴挈一壶，折荷以爲盏。\n入竹藤似虵，侵墙水成藓。\n幽鸟不识人，时来拂冠冕。\n沿流路若穷，及行路犹远。\n洞中已云夕，洞口天未晚。\n自怜不羁者，写物心常简。\n飜愁此兴多，引得嵇康嬾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}